ata-end=\"688\">Conditie:</strong> Nieuw</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"701\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"721\">🔹 Voordelen</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"874\">✔ Modern en sportief design<br data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"752\">✔ Activiteit- en sporttracking<br data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"785\">✔ Meldingen direct op je pols<br data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"817\">✔ Compatibel met Android & iOS<br data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"850\">✔ Zeer scherp geprijsd</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"876\" data-end=\"879\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"895\">🔹 Prijs</h3>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"907\"><strong data-start=\"896\" data-end=\"907\">€ 49,99</strong></p>",
